{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221180","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322118001:1":{"text":"제 잘못이에요... 제가 사람들을 놀래켰어요...","source_cn":"是我的错……我吓到他们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA7D62753DA2BB62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322118002:1":{"text":"최근에 너무 많은 일이 벌어졌어요. 방금 일어난 일 때문에 사람들을 더 불안해진 건 아닌지 걱정되네요.","source_cn":"最近发生了太多事，我很担心，或许刚才发生的一切会让他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA858C18B392223D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322118003:1":{"text":"캐롤라이나. 당신 잘못이 아니에요! 에휴, 다들 화이트마운틴의 그레이브본에 대한 진실을 알면 좋겠는데...","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，这也不能怪你啦。唉，要是大家都知道白山亡灵诞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC43BA46CF28E2E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322118004:1":{"text":"하지만 2천 년 동안 이곳 사람들은 그레이브본을 사악함의 상징으로 여겼어요. 그런 인식이 너무 뿌리가 깊어서 진실을 알더라도 생각은 쉽게 바뀌지 않을 거예요.","source_cn":"可是两千年以来，这里的人们都觉得亡灵是邪恶的象征。这种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6280ADBBEB26D343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322118005:1":{"text":"전... 그레이브본에 대한 사람들의 인식을 바꾸고 싶었어요. 하지만...","source_cn":"我……我的本意是希望用行动改变人们对亡灵的看法，但没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC98ECE24BF71D995","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322118006:1":{"text":"저들에게 사과해야 해요.","source_cn":"我应该向他们道歉才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6E895662BF55C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1322118006":{"text":"저들에게 사과해야 해요.","source_cn":"我应该向他们道歉才是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF6E895662BF55C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322118007:1":{"text":"맞아요... 일단 성직자들에게서 멀어져야겠어요.","source_cn":"你说得对……我应该先避开这里的圣职者们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFD5508C4A76B7B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322118008:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요. 놀란 사람들에게 저 대신 사과해 주세요.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7686C65F09395859","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요. 놀란 사람들에게 저 대신 사과해 주세요.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 부탁드려요. 놀란 사람들에게 저 대신 사과해 주세요.","variant_male_record_index":"149237","variant_female_record_index":"149238","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322118009:1":{"text":"우리에게 맡겨요! 우리가 전부 설명할게요!","source_cn":"交给我们吧！我们会向大家解释清楚的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC20B7CC34B59A305","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"우리가 먼저 상황을 살펴볼게","source_cn":"还是我们先去看看情况","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD5F1D8ADDB62F17E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"우리가 먼저 상황을 살펴볼게","female":"우리가 먼저 상황을 살펴볼게","variant_male_record_index":"69454","variant_female_record_index":"69455","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:1:2":{"text":"지금은 때가 좋지 않아...","source_cn":"恐怕现在不合适……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8B9904971858C1D7","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"지금은 때가 좋지 않아...","female":"지금은 때가 좋지 않아...","variant_male_record_index":"69456","variant_female_record_index":"69457","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}